  "description": "Wind-tunnel thermal runs of small brushless motors with propellers (1 Hz transients from start to thermal steady state, and summary rows at spool-up and at steady state) and the motor sizing tables of Saemi, Whitson and Benedict, Texas A&M University. Adopted for the TASK-105 thermal comparison by the stakeholder's decision of 2026-11-08, since there is no thrust stand. The files are not in the repository; they are kept outside every checkout and passed to the comparison by directory; this file holds each file's SHA-256 and size, with paths relative to the directory the archives unpack into.",
  "citation": "S. Saemi, M. Whitson, M. Benedict, Aerospace 11 (2024) 401, doi:10.3390/aerospace11050401. Data: doi:10.6084/m9.figshare.25658493 (thermal data 2024-04-20) and doi:10.6084/m9.figshare.26107465 (sizing data 2024-06-26).",
  "license": "CC BY 4.0",
